@prefix asig: <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/signal#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/signal> skos:scopeNote "Use for sampled signals; state channel organization and units separately from sample rate."@en .
asig:SampleRateShape rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/signal> .
asig:sampleRate skos:definition "The number of sample instants per second for a sampled signal, expressed in hertz. Channel count is separate; a multi-channel sample instant is not multiplied by its number of channels."@en .
